  "title": "Plumas Bancorp Reports Record First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "RENO, Nev., April 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Plumas Bancorp (Nasdaq: PLBC), the parent company of Plumas Bank (the “Bank”), today announced record first quarter earnings of $9.8 million or $1.40 per share, up from $7.2 million or $1.21 per share during the first quarter of 2025. Diluted earnings per share was $1.38 during the three months ended March 31, 2026, up from $1.20 per share during the quarter ended March 31, 2025. Return on average assets was 1.78% during the current quarter, down sli",
